    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d717">

                <pb facs="0851" n="755" xml:id="pg755"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">760n.61/6a: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Commissioner at
                        Riga</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Young</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1921-05-07T17:00:00-04:00"><hi rendition="#italic">May 7, 1921—5
                                p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>61. Your 386, 387, 388, Hollyday’s 193 and 198.<anchor n="66" xml:id="d717-f1"/>
                    Report at once by cable briefly your opinion as to probability of any early
                    Bolshevik effort military or peaceful to absorb Baltic States and probability of
                    success as affecting possible recognition of Esthonia and Latvia by the United
                    States.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hughes</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
